<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef uneven on fairly good demand and moderate to heavy offerings.  Select and Choice middle meats generally steady, while chuck cuts weak and round cuts uneven. Beef trimmings higher on moderate demand and light to moderate offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>373 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>104 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>32 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =	96.69	 95.50	 93.05	 92.31</p>
<p>Change	   -0.34	 -0.26	 -0.39	  0.01</p>
<p>Rib	  150.57	147.62	141.09	140.81</p>
<p>Chuck	 69.42	 67.81	 69.79	 67.71</p>
<p>Round	 87.24	 87.24	 87.07	 87.07</p>
<p>Loin	 143.02	141.18	130.70	130.30</p>
